    {
      "description": "This is the section that did not exist when this list was first written. In five years, robot manipulation moved from \"write an inverse-kinematics solver and a state machine\" to \"collect demonstrations and train a policy.\" Both approaches are alive; a mechatronic engineer in 2026 needs to know when to reach for which.",
