              "description": "🆓 — Hugging Face's end-to-end robot learning library. , no ROS required. Includes ACT, Diffusion Policy, VQ-BeT, π₀, SmolVLA, HIL-SERL, TD-MPC. ⭐ 📄 ICLR 2026",
